## Part 1 change summary

File: src/__tests__/phase-4-contact-copy.red.test.tsx (4 D5 pins).
The exact en/th/zh TikTok sentences are gone. One case now checks that
pages.contact.social.tiktok is a non-empty string in every shipped locale.
The locale list comes from localeConfig.locales in src/config/locale-config.ts.
The three rendered cases keep their structural checks for one TikTok token
and one handle token. They no longer pin the full sentence.

New helper: src/__tests__/fixtures/locale-key-check.ts. It reads the shipped
locale list from the app config and checks each dotted key in every locale.

Kept as K: none in this part.
- The raw handle config assertion was removed. classification.md line 178 says
  the contact-authority test keeps that value.
- No legal fact, price, money figure, customer date, or claim limit was touched.
- No tutor-commission money test was touched.

